# PrimeWeb

## Dependencies
node_modules/
# Repo uses npm (package-lock.json). Stray pnpm/yarn lockfiles break
# `vercel build` — it auto-detects pnpm from the file and spawns a pnpm
# binary that does not exist on the GH Actions runner (ENOENT). Seen
# twice: 83f91a75, then PR #555 (commit e4d0448c) reintroduced it.
pnpm-lock.yaml
yarn.lock

## Next.js
.next/
out/

## Build
dist/
build/

